{"asset_key":"ep3/herohub_story_13411230","episode":"ep3","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"13411230","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1341123001:1":{"text":"ロンロン、どうしてそんな不思議そうな目で私の武器を見つめているの？","source_cn":"满满，你为什么用这么奇怪的眼神看着我的武器？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x138816FA14A7BCF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1341123002:1":{"text":"ヴェリカさんの剣は本当に綺麗ですね！それに鎧も……かっこよくて、実用的で、まさに理想的な騎士の装備です！","source_cn":"你的骑士大剑可真漂亮！还有你的板甲……又精美又实用，是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50C4C420C238137A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1341123003:1":{"text":"ふふ、ありがとう。剣と鎧は騎士が最も信頼する仲間であり、尊厳と栄光の象徴でもあるものね。","source_cn":"那当然，它们是一位骑士最能信赖的伙伴，也是骑士的尊严和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF672E706746B31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1341123004:1":{"text":"ですです！何があっても、ロンロンは剣と鎧を手放したりしません！","source_cn":"对呀对呀！无论如何，满满都不会抛弃剑和胸甲，就算是掉进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF71D6C055437560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1341123005:1":{"text":"この前、ストーミー海峡で海に落ちた時だって、ロンロンは鎧を脱ぎませんでしたから！","source_cn":"上次在斯托密海峡遭遇海难的时候，满满就是穿着它们沉到海里的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C30596988921140","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1341123006:1":{"text":"えっと……それはさすがに脱いだ方が……命あっての物種、でしょう？","source_cn":"咳，其实……也不必这么坚持……生命第一位，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x341F5E450749774D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"ヴェリカ","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"ロンロン","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":2}}